  << /ActualText (My name is ABIGAIL MOABI\056 My journey in higher \neducation has been full of challenges and growth\056\nImagine being away from home to study\054trying to \nbalance your independence and overcoming self\055doubt\056\nAll these experiences shaped me\056I realized that there are some students like me who thrive when they connect in their own way especially when they can share knowledge without the pressure of a crowd\056)
